    {
      "id": "ADR-17",
      "conflict_subject": "持久化、提交、重放与故障边界",
      "coordination_proposal": "以 opening seed 与 append-only authoritative Events 定义 replay lineage；current-head/materialization/index/snapshot 不是独立历史真相；权威转换最终采用 all-or-zero 提交、确定性且幂等的 retry/replay/recovery，并禁止同一 World 的竞争 committed writers。实现按 V07 Command/Event/Replay、V08 Ledger/Posting、V09 writer/lease/fencing/atomic-commit/recovery 的权威归属分阶段完成。",
      "decision_status": "APPROVED",
      "approval_record": "docs/architecture/decisions/ADR-17.md",
